module

public import Mathlib.RingTheory.RingHom.Flat
public import Mathlib.RingTheory.LocalRing.ResidueField.Basic

@[expose] public section

universe u v

namespace IsLocalRing

/-- Source: Stacks Project, Algebra, Lemma 10.159.1 (Tag 03C3), first proof paragraph.
(blueprint: new-flat-local-monogenic-extension)

Proof: The image F of ψ is a field, since ker ψ is the maximal ideal of A and the
quotient A/ker ψ is its residue field. If x is transcendental over F, evaluate A[T]
at x and localize at the ideal of polynomials whose coefficients lie in the maximal
ideal of A. Transcendence identifies this ideal with the evaluation kernel, so it is
prime and evaluation extends to the localization. This localization is local, with
maximal ideal generated by that of A, and its evaluation kernel is that maximal ideal.
A[T] is free over A and localization is flat, so the composite is flat. The class of T
maps to x. If x is algebraic over F, lift the coefficients of its monic minimal
polynomial to A and take B = A[T]/(the lifted monic polynomial). The power basis makes
B finite free, hence flat over A. Evaluation descends. Polynomial division by the
monic polynomial shows its kernel is exactly the extended maximal ideal of A, and
its image is the field F(x). Thus this ideal is maximal. Every maximal ideal of B
contracts to the maximal ideal of A because B is integral over A; it therefore
contains, and equals, the extended ideal. Hence B is local. Again the class of T
maps to x. Both constructions have carriers in Type (max u v), the universe of A. -/
theorem exists_flat_local_monogenic_extension
    (A : Type (max u v)) [CommRing A] [IsLocalRing A]
    (K : Type v) [Field K] (ψ : A →+* K)
    (hker : RingHom.ker ψ = maximalIdeal A) (x : K) :
    ∃ (B : Type (max u v)) (_ : CommRing B) (_ : IsLocalRing B)
      (_ : Algebra A B) (φ : B →+* K),
      (algebraMap A B).Flat ∧
      (maximalIdeal A).map (algebraMap A B) = maximalIdeal B ∧
      RingHom.ker φ = maximalIdeal B ∧
      φ.comp (algebraMap A B) = ψ ∧ ∃ b, φ b = x := by sorry

end IsLocalRing
